<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">RUT-LUT NGƆMBƐ-BONDALE</book>
  <para style="h1">Luta</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lut</para>
  <para style="toc2">LUTA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buku e Luta</para>
  <para style="mt1">Buku e Luta</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buku e Luta</para>
  <para style="imt1">Eingeli e buku</para>
  <para style="ip">Isolo i Luta ilotɔndeaka meako minɔkɔ ta ehole eyou kaoko ta ehole e badjudji, elenge abalakabo tina e badaledji ba bato ba Isalɛlɛ, endolo ekomamaka ta masu makina, edi bopipo ta bodjeba yanga emina.</para>
  <para style="ip">Buku emina ekomamaka tine boinedja moda ndani mwali mokɛndɛli akweaka ta ibota i bato ba Ndjakomba. Einedjaka mɛnɛ moda boboana na iputi i bohula: moda mondjokwa ebɔngedjama kaoko moda modakayo, Luta ko bokiyo bo nde mwali Naomi moimeaka bosɔmbɔ naikina bonɛngɛ ko na mohelo mopele. Mokanda mu, mokomama na bɔɔ bonɛnɛ, einedjaka embete esɛnɔke edimanake ta iputo i bato ko na edimaneli adi Ndjakomba.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bobotama bo mwana o Luta edi inango i mokanda mu: na bea mwana omina aimeaka kɔkɔ e Dapiti. Adaka motitani o bakɔkɔ ba Dapiti, Luta mwali o ngando e Moaba adiaka polo ta molɔngɔ mo batitani ba Yesu (Mat 1, 5).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Elimelɛki ta ngondo e Moaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Ta masu madaledjaka bilombe Isalɛlɛ, ndja edaka enɛnɛ ta ngondo. Na bea momi omɔti o ngando e Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, ta mokpɔtɔ mo Yuda, akɛkɛ bodikama ta eliki e Moaba: yo, mwali o nde, engbanga na bana ba nde bami babae. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Kombe e momi omina edaka Elimelɛki, kombe e mwali o nde edaka Naomi ko kombe i bana ba nde babae bami idaka Maloni na Kilioni. Badaka bato ba itungu i Epalata, ta ngando e Bɛtɛlɛmɛ e mo kpɔtɔ mo Yuda. Bakɛkɛ ta eliki e Moaba ko badikamaka oho. <verse eid="RUT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Na bea Elimelɛki, momi o Naomi, agwaka ena ko Naomi adikaka yo mɛnɛ na bana ba nde bami babae. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Bana bami babae bimina baosɔkɔ baseka ba eliki e Moaba ; o boso kombe e nde edaka Olopa ko o babae Luta. Ngɔngɔ i bobo boyeyoa oho mbuti na bianga domi, <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Maloni na Kilioni bagwaka pongono. Naomi adikaka yo mɛnɛ: pɛ bana ko pɛ momi.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Luta ayani na Naomi ta ngando e Bɛtɛlɛmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Kumu Yawɛ aokeaka bato ba nde ndjokwa: abapaka mia ma boyaka. Ehole eokaka Naomi bea, asalingoaka bɛngi akine eliki e Moaba, ayane ta mokpɔtɔ mo Yuda, engbanga na bakio ba nde. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Engbanga na bakio ba nde bali, Naomi adongaka ta polo edaka yo ko ayanaka ta mokpɔtɔ mo Yuda. <verse eid="RUT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Naomi abalaka na bakio ba nde: «Edɛdi yanani, moto na moto ta ndako e nange e nde. Kina boo Kumu Yawɛ aokɔmeni bopele elenge akɔ no na bia ibagwa ko na mbi mɛnɛ! <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Kina boo Yawɛ apɛ omɔti na omɔti o bino bogo ta ndako e momi okina!» Abhimbaka bakio ba nde babae bɛngi agbɔte na bu, endolo bayeaka mɛnɛ. <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />Babalaka na nde: «Ngasa! Lakɛke na wɛ engbanga adi pako e wɛ». <verse eid="RUT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Endolo Naomi abasɔmbedjaka: «Bana ba mbi bali, yanani ta ndako i bino! Tina ndani wakimanakanini? Okani, naboani naikina bobota bana bami baboani boasɔni? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Bana ba mbi, yanani adi no. Tengasa naimei mobange mɛnɛ naboaniti bokɛ naikina moki. Nongo nakabala boo nadi oko na ngulu, nadi na ndingo boo nadi bobota ; na bea naimani na momi ta bulu bu ko ngɔngɔ naboti bana bami. <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />Ibea, wambakeni mbunoko bakandoe? Oboanitini bokɛni meki mikina? Ngasa, bana ba mbi bali! Ndjokwa e mbi enɔi ndjokwa e bino, tengasa ebɔ e Yawɛ ebenedjini mɛnɛ!»<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Ehole eokaka bo bea, bayeaka naikina na ngulu mɛnɛ. Bea Olopa abhimbaka bokio bo nde ko amopaka ndese esuka, endolo Luta alonaka bogbɔtɔ na nde. <verse eid="RUT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Naomi abalaka na Luta: «Endja, mbanda e wɛ ayani adi bato ba nde ko adi ba ndjakomba ba nde. Wɛ pongono yana!» <verse eid="RUT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Endolo Luta amosɔmbedjaka: «Pɛ bolindedjani nokine bɛngi na yane.Tengasa polo esusu akɛke wɛ, mbi nakɛke ; polo esusu adake wɛ, mbi nadake. Bato ba wɛ badake bato ba mbi ; ko Ndjakomba o wɛ adake Ndjakomba o mbi; <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />oho agwake wɛ, mbi pongono nagwake; ko ena polo akundakenibo. Kina boo Yawɛ apɛni etumbo epipo emitida boo yogo elogbɔtodje!» <verse eid="RUT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Ehole enɛkɛ Naomi boo Luta adaka oko atingi bokɛ na nde engbanga, akinaka bobala na nde. <verse eid="RUT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Na tina emina, bakɛkɛ bo babae engbanga mbunoko baimeaka ta ngando e Bɛtɛlɛmɛ. Ehole eimeakabo ta Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, ngando e isusu eokaka ndjokwa tine bobo. Ko bali badaka bohɔdjɔ: «Iyo oko Naomi?» <verse eid="RUT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Naomi abalaka na bu: «Pɛ bobeanini naikina Naomi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Etingodji mongandi.</char></note>, endolo beanini Mala<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1, 20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Etingodji boyo.</char></note> tengasa Ndjakomba o ngulu isusu aokedjini ndjokwa enɛnɛ. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Nakɛkɛ mɔmɔ molumake, endolo Yawɛ ahuledjini mɔmɔ ngasa! Tina ebobeani naikina Naomi nda? Kumu Ndjakomba o ngulu isusu aokedjini ndjokwa.» <verse eid="RUT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Edaka mondumba moyanaka Naomi ta mokpɔtɔ mo Yuda, donga ta eliki e Moaba engbanga na Luta, moto o Moaba, bokio bo nde mwali. Baimeaka ta ngando e Bɛtɛlɛmɛ, ta ehole ekabuke bo mbuma i ɔlɔge.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Luta andoi mbuma ta gbie e Boadji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Naomi adaka na moto omɔti ta pako e muma nde, yona odaka o itungu i Elimelɛki. Adaka modieli mɛnɛ kombe e nde Boadji. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Luta, moto o Moaba, abalaka na Naomi: «Pani enɔi e bokɛ ta gbie, tine boandoa mingbɔndu mi mbuma i bule, imia madumbaka babukeli. Nadake ngɔngɔ i moto okeakeni mongandi.» Naomi abalaka na nde: «Kɛ mwana o mbi mwali.» <verse eid="RUT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Luta akɛkɛ ko abangaka boandoa mbuma i bule ta gbie, ngɔngɔ i babukeli. Asakanaka na ibaku ipele, tengasa adua asipoa boo adaka bosala ta gbie e Boadji, moto o pako e Elimelɛki.<verse eid="RUT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Ngɔngɔ i moehole, Boadji ahulaka ta ngando e Bɛtɛlɛmɛ. Aiseaka babukeli ba mbuma na mibalo mi ko abalaka: «Kina boo Yawɛ adae engbanga na nu!» Bamosɔmbedjaka: «Kina boo Yawɛ aodjongoe!» <verse eid="RUT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Boadji ahɔdjɔkɔ kapita o babukeli ba mbuma i bule: «Moseka mwali yona, adi o nda?» <verse eid="RUT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Kapita o babukeli ba mbuma i bule asɔmbedjaka: «Adi moseka mwali o Moaba. Adoi engbanga na Naomi donga ta ngondo e Moaba. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Alosɛngi enɔi e boandoa mingbɔndu i mbuma i bule i mia mikadike, ehole ekanangebo maboke, ngɔngɔ i babukeli. Donga ehuma ye akweaki ta gbie, asali na bhingi esusu, mbunoko ahemi oko edɛdi mooehole mokɛkɛ.» <verse eid="RUT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Na bea Boadji abalaka na Luta: «Oka bopele mwambi mwali. Pɛ bokɛ andoa mbuma i bule ta gbie ekina ; ko pɛ bokɛ bohali na gbie ye, endolo yeyoa ya engbanga na basali ba mbi bali. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Endja bopele pamba ndani alenaka bo mbuma i bule ko daa ngɔngɔ i bana bali ibandoaka mbuma i bule. Nasii basali bami badae pɛ bopea. Ehole esusu okoka posa e madiba, kɛɛ amwake ta mbola ilumedji bami.» <verse eid="RUT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Ehole eokaka Luta bea, asuneaka boso mbunoko ta kpɔtɔ ko abalaka na Boadji: «Tina ndani nadihi mongandi mu ta miso ma wɛ ko tina ndani opini ekumu iye mbi odi mokɛndɛli?» <verse eid="RUT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Boadji asɔmbedjaka: «Batɔndeini meako misusu imikɔ wɛ na bokio bo wɛ, donga ehole egwaka muma wɛ, moda mokina wɛ sange e wɛ, nange e wɛ ko ngando e bakɔkɔ ba wɛ ; odoi adaa na bato ibadaa wɛ pɛ bodjeba. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Kina boo Yawɛ aopute, tine meako mikɔi wɛ! Kina boo Yawɛ, Ndjakomba o Isalɛlɛ, aopute bonɔ, elenge adoi wɛ abolama ta nase i mangbangu ma nde!» <verse eid="RUT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Luta abalaka: «Kina boo nadie mongandi ta miso ma wɛ, kumu o mbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Odi mɛnɛ mopele tine e mbi </char><char style="fp" closed="false">ta mobalo mokina </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Daa mopele tina e mbi!</char></note>! Opini molema bogo, tengasa osoli na mwali mosali o wɛ, na bwɛla bosusu. Enakobea, naboanakiti boda nongo omɔti o basali bali ba wɛ.» <verse eid="RUT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Ta ehole e boyaka, Boadji abalaka na Luta: «Batama mbuti ko tomba ekenge e mwɛmbɛ, edubea ta mana ma ngai.» Ehole edaka yo na bato bakabuke mbuma i bule, Boadji amopaka baa mbuma bakalangake. Aiyaka elenge apalaka yo ko akinaka ikina. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Ehole angɔkɔ yo tine boandoa mbuma i bule, Boadji apaka mobeko adi basali ba nde: «Mokinani andoe nongo idjia idi ndanda i bibole, pɛ bomoyekeani<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2, 15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta bopele baboanaka boandoa mbuma oko babukeli bosidja mosala mbunoko mele misie bodongedja.</char></note>. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Oboanini bosambeani mele mi mikina midi na mbuma, tina e nde bɛngi amiandoe. Pɛ bomoyolodjani.» <verse eid="RUT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Na bea Luta andoaka mbuma i bule ta gbie mbunoko mɔmɔkɔ. Ngɔngɔ abomakaka mingbɔndu imiandoaka yo, alumedjaka sɛki emɔti na mbuma i ɔlɔge. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Ayanaka na yu ta ibonga ko bokio bo nde mwali aenɛkɛ mbuma djandoaka yo. Luta aimedjaka naikina mia imakinaka yo ehole egolaka yo ko amapaka adi bokio bo nde. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Naomi ahɔdjɔkɔ Luta: «Busa bu andoi wɛ mbuma djɔ? Osali ta gbie e nda? Kina boo moto opi ekumu ye, adjongoame!» Na bea Luta atɔndeaka bokio bo nde meako imimedjaka moswa gbie ta polo esalaka yo. Abalaka kombe e moto omina edaka Boadji. <verse eid="RUT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />Naomi abalaka na bokio bo nde mwali: «Kina boo Yawɛ adjongoame, iyo odai pɛ bokina boinedja bopele bo nde adi bato ba nde: edae adi bato ibadi mɔ kaoko ibagwa. Momi yona adi mwange e biso adi ta tei e molɔngɔ mo bato baboani bolosikoa!» <verse eid="RUT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Na bea Luta Moaba abalaka: «Daa engbanga na basali ba mbi mbunoko basidje bobuka mbuma i ɔlɔge i mbi isusu.» <verse eid="RUT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Naomi asɔmbedjaka Luta, bokio bo nde: «Edi bopele tine wɛ bodala engbanga na basali ba nde bali. Tengasa okakɛ ta gbie e moto okina oboani boinedja saya.» <verse eid="RUT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Na bea Luta adaka mbuti na basali ba Boadji, tine boandoa mingbɔndu mi mbuma i bule, mbunoko ehole abukake bo mbuma i ɔlɔge ko na mbuma i bule ikasia. Ayeyoaka boda engbanga na bokio bo nde mwali.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Luta anɔdji bulu bosusu ta mako ma Boadji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Busa bomɔti, Naomi bokio bo Luta mwali, abalaka na nde: «Mwana o mbi, naboaniti bohombea polo e bogo, edi wɛ boda na sepi? <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Tengasa otungi bodjeba bopele boo Boadji yona osalaka engbanga na basali ba nde bali, adi mwange e biso. Enakobea mɔmɔkɔ mo busa bu, akɛke bopɛpɛ ɔlɔge ta polo e bhuda ekadjibomakakebo. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Na bea sasosa bopele, sasuowa mosoloa ko lwa bisendja bi wɛ, ibinɔi na bopele. Na bea, okɛdea ta polo e bhuda, oho abomakaka yo ɔlɔge i nde; endolo kɔɔbo Boadji adɛ pɛ bodjeba boo odi ta polo emina mbunoko akasidja boyaka ko bomwaka. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Ehole akɛke yo asaama, homba odjebe polo asamake yo. Ngɔngɔ osabatee ko okundoe esendja yena ekundi mako ma nde, osasambee ena ta mako ma nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Embete ye ebwani na ihɔdjɔ i e bana ta pamba e Luta, endja molɔngɔ mo ibuwa. Ebwani boda mbuno e boasɔnɔ.</char></note>. Yo mɛnɛ aotɔndeake meako miboani na wɛ bokɔ.» <verse eid="RUT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Luta amosɔmbedjaka: «Nakɔke misusu mitɔndeini wɛ.»<verse eid="RUT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Luta akɛkɛ ta polo e bhuda emina, oho akɔkɔ meako misusu mimotɔndeaka bokio bo nde. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Ehole esidjaka Boadji boyaka ko bomwaka, molema mo nde modaka na sepi, akɛkɛ asaama ta suka e bibole bi mbuma i ɔlɔge. Na bea Luta asabateaka bopɛtɛ bopɛtɛ, akundoaka esendja yena edipaka mako ma Boadji ko asamaka ena. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Ta ndanda e bulu, Boadji aokaka piyɔ, asaninodjaka ko aenɛkɛ mwali asambi ta mako ma nde. <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Wɛ nda?» Asɔmbedjaka: «Edi mbi, Luta, mosali o wɛ mwali. Anda sɔngɔ e esendja e wɛ mbunoko ono adi mbi, tengasa odi na kpatsi e bosikoa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3, 9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mosala mo moboti: Endja 2.20.</char></note>.» <verse eid="RUT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Boadji amosɔmbedjaka: «Kina boo Yawɛ aodjongoe, mwana o mbi mwali! Bopele bosinedja wɛ edɛdi, bonɔi bo boso. Tengasa, odalati ngɔngɔ i menga bami, edɛ badieli kaoko batakeli. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Edɛdi, mwana o mbi mwali pɛ bobanga! Nokɔmeake misusu ma sengɛke wɛ, tengasa bato basusu ba polo ye badjebi boo odi mwali o mandi. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Nongo edɛdi adi mbi na kpatsi e bosikoa, endolo edi na mosikoi okina adi mbuti na wɛ bonɔ mbi. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Hwɛ bulu bu iya; na bea puma ehuma, loendje kaoko moto omina adi bodima bosikoa. Ekada boo apali, kina boo aosikoe. Endolo akalona, nabali na wɛ ta kombe e Yawɛ boo nosikoake. Na bea boso boo busa boyɛ, hwɛ iya.» <verse eid="RUT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Luta ahwɛkɛ ta mako ma Boadji ko asisoaka na hindihindi yana adaka bato pɛ bokokoledja bopele. Tengasa Boadji abalaka, moto adae pɛ bodjeba boo mwali omɔti aduaki ta polo e bhuda ye ekabomakakebo ɔlɔge. <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Boso boo ayane, Boadji amotɔndeaka: «Pani esendja ye elwali wɛ ko epea bopele.» Luta apeaka esendja ko Boadji amoiseaka kilo mbuti na tuku ibae i mbuma ɔlɔge, amokamoaka na boangɔdjɔ ko amobakee ta molo. Ngɔngimina, Luta ayanaka ta ibonga. <verse eid="RUT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Ehole eimeaka Luta adi bokio bo nde, Naomi amohɔdjɔkɔ: «Mwana o mbi mwali, meako mimina minɔi bo?» Na bea Luta amotɔndeaka meako misusu mimokɔmeaka Boadji. <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />Abalaka: «Apini pongono kilo tuku ibae i mbuma i ɔlɔge, tengasa adjebedjakini boo, otayana mɔmɔ ngasa adi bokio bo wɛ.» <verse eid="RUT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Na bea Naomi abalaka na nde: «Edɛdi mwana o mbi mwali, daaya mbunoko odjebe moda masukeake meako mimina. Tengasa, moto yona atadake na bogo mbunoko oko asidje meako mi busa bu!»<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Boadji asangoi bodieli bo Elimelɛki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Boadji akɛkɛ ta ekukɛ e ibonga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekukɛ e Ibonga edaka polo e mohelo mo bato: Polo edaka bo tine bokata makambo ma bato ko bobɔngedja maeako mi ibonga inɛnɛ.</char></note>, ko adaka oho. Aenɛkɛ mosikoi, yona obalaka Boadji boo yo adi na kpatsi e bosikoa Luta, bonɔ. Boadji abalaka na nde: «Mwange e mbi, duwa ko daa ya.» Moto omina asabateaka ko adaaka. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Boadji abeaka bami domi ta tei e basuku ba ibonga ko ahɔdjɔkɔ boo adae na bu engbanga. Ehole edakabo, <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Boadji abalaka na mosikoi o Luta: «Naomi yona ahuli ta eliki e Moaba, atɛkɛkɛ gbie e Elimelɛki, mwange e biso. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Mbi nadiaki ilɛno i botɔndea ko bobala na wɛ boo osombe gbie emina ta miso ma bato ba ibonga ko na basuku ibadi iya. Okapala boesomba, esomba; emitida bea, tɔndeani bɛngi nadjebe. Tengasa wɛ odi moto o boso odi na kpatsi boesomba ko mbi nadi na enɔei ngɔngɔ i wɛ.» Moto omina amosɔmbedjaka: «Eee, naesombaka.» <verse eid="RUT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Boadji abalaka: «Ehole asombake wɛ gbie ta mɔmɔ ma Naomi, watombake pongono Luta Moaba, mwali ogwa na momi, tine ebokɔ boo kombe e mowei edike bodieli bo nde.» <verse eid="RUT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Mosikoi abalaka: «Naboaniti naesikoe esakadabo naisi djenge ta bodieli bo mbi. Esikoa wɛ mɛnɛ tengasa mbi nataboana bokɔ bea.» <verse eid="RUT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Enakobea ta ehole eyou ta Isalɛlɛ, tine bosikoa ko bopa bodieli, moto omɔti adaka boihwa sapato i nde ko bodjipa adi moto okina. Sapato imina idaka elenge mbete e tati ta tei e Isalɛlɛ. <verse eid="RUT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Mosikoi abalaka na Boadji boo somba gbie emina. Na bea aiwaka sapato i nde ko amopaka. <verse eid="RUT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Boadji atɔndeaka basuku ko bato basusu: «Ino bɛnɛ odini batemo boo nasombe ta mɔmɔ ma Naomi bodieli bosusu bo Elimelɛki bo Kilioni na Maloni. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Natombi pongongo Luta moseka o Moaba, yona odaka mwali o Maloni o gwa, tine boo aimee mwali o mbi. Tengasa kombe e nde edike ta bodieli bo nde, esaka bunga ta tei e pako e nde ko ta tei e buku e Leta e ibonga i nde. Ino odini batemo bamina busa bu.» <verse eid="RUT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Na bea basuku ko na bato basusu ibadaka ta ekukɛ e ibonga babalaka: «Eee, lodimi lodi batemo. Kina boo Yawɛ aimedje mwali yo aduake ta ndako e wɛ; elenge Laele na Lea ibabotaka engbanga pako e bato ba Isalɛlɛ! Kina boo oimee moto monɛnɛ ta tei itungu i e Epalata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Laele na Lea: bali babae ba Djakobo, endja ta Mba 29, 11ss. </char><char style="fp" closed="false">Epalata: endja ta 1, 2.</char></note> ko moto o gala ta ngando isusu i Bɛtɛlɛmɛ! <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Kina boo batitani ibopake Yawɛ na ndjea e moseka mwali yo, baimedje ndako e wɛ elenge ndako e Pɛlɛse, yena ebotaka Tamala Yuda!»<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Boadji asɔi Luta; bobotama bo Obɛde, kɔkɔ e Dapiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Na bea Boadji atombaka Luta ko amoasɔkɔ. Ngɔngɔ i Boadji boda moki na Luta, Yawɛ adjongoaka Luta ko alwaka demi ko abotaka mwana momi. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Bali ba ngando i Bɛtɛlɛmɛ babalaka na Naomi: «Kina boo Yawɛ akumedjame! Yo, yoo ta busa bu aiokina botakedja mosikoi ta ibota i wɛ! Kina boo kombe e mwana omina ekɛ gala ta Isalɛlɛ! <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Asɔmbedjake mohelo mo wɛ ko aobaneake ta bobange bo wɛ. Tengasa bokio bo wɛ mwali, yona okopale ko adi natɛtɔ enɛnɛ bonɔ bana bami sambo, aobotei mwana momi.» <verse eid="RUT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Naomi atombaka mwana ko amogopeaka ta bupa bo nde<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4, 16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edi embete e epaeli, kokanedja ta Mba 30, 3-8; 48, 5-12; 50, 23.</char></note>, aimeaka ndɛli. <verse eid="RUT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Bali ba ngando yena badumbeaka: «Naomi adihi pape!» Ko bamobakeaka kombe e Obɛde. Obɛde adaka sange e Yese ko Yese adaka sange e Dapiti.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Molɔngɔ mo bobotama mo bakɔkɔ ba Dapiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Endja molɔngɔ mo bobotama mo bakɔkɔ ba Dapiti donga Pɛlɛtse: Pɛlɛse adaka sange e Eselɔne; <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Eselɔne adaka sange e Lama, Lama adaka sange e Aminadaba; <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadaba adaka sange e Nasone, Nasone adaka sange e Salama, <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salama adaka sange e Boadji, Boadji adaka sange e Obɛde; <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Obɛde adaka sange e Yese ko Yese adaka sange e Dapiti.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>